<title>JAPAN: IBM launches 4.65% yen/dlr samurais -- Daiwa.</title>
<headline>IBM launches 4.65% yen/dlr samurais -- Daiwa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following yen/dollar dual currency samurai issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p>BORROWER International Business Machines Corp</p>
<p>    AMT	50 bln yen</p>
<p>    COUPON   4.65 pct</p>
<p>MATURITY 20 June 2000 </p>
<p>    TYPE		dual currency samurai</p>
<p>    ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p>    PAY DATE	  20 Dec 1996</p>
<p>    SUB PERIOD	Dec 3 to Dec 19</p>
<p>    PAY FREQ	  Annual</p>
<p>    LAST RATING     S&amp;P A, Moody's A1</p>
<p>    LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p>    LEAD TRUSTEE    Mitsubishi Trust &amp; Banking</p>
<p>NOTES: Holders of the samurai bonds will receive $4,427.13 for each 500,000-yen bond held at maturity.</p>
</text>
